        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-ANDERSON-BEYOND-980.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-ANDERSON-BEYOND-980-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH981-AUTONOMY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH982-BARRIER-MERKLE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH983-SYM-AUDIT-LAT-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH984-985M-SAAT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH985-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-ANDERSON-BEYOND-980-WIT  PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-ANDERSON-BEYOND-980.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-ANDERSON-BEYOND-980.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH981-AUTONOMY-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH982-BARRIER-MERKLE-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH983-SYM-AUDIT-LAT-OK = 1 AND
